---
source: crates/efr-cli/src/cli/tests.rs
expression: add.render_help().to_string()
---
Register a project: PATH, or without one the git work tree that holds the current directory (else the directory itself)

Usage: efr project add [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  The project's root directory; relative to the current directory

Options:
      --name <NAME>  A name for the project; the last part of the root by default
  -h, --help         Print help
